827D FD E9        	        JP (IY)                 ; total high slot 5: 10+4+10+8 = 32 T
                 	
                 	; Main HL wrapped to zero. Only H needs loading for the next aligned bank.
                 	; Bank holds [74,72,74,73,72,72,79,67,73,72,71] = 799 T.
